0 Kestrel - Flapping linkage
0 Name: kestrel-flapper.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/kestrel-flapper.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Kestrel design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Stock40/120/80/120LDU crank-rocker with a real pinned wing and one input motor A.
0 // Original linkage dimensions, pinned wing, frame and native program; no scripted output motion.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: kestrel-flapper.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Grashof crank-rocker demonstration; physical assembly and aerodynamic performance untested.
